Subject: store the initial browser command line in GooroomMain

Upstream ChromeMain() captures an unpolluted snapshot of the browser command
line right after CommandLine::Init() and before any programmatic mutation:

    if (!command_line->HasSwitch(switches::kProcessType))
      GetInitialCommandLineStorage() = *command_line;

GooroomMain() replaces ChromeMain() as the entry point but never had that
block, so the storage stays empty. GetInitialBrowserCommandLine() dereferences
it with .value() and aborts with

    bad_optional_access was thrown in -fno-exceptions mode

The defect was latent until 153: chrome/browser/ui/webui/policy/policy_ui.cc
started calling GetInitialBrowserCommandLine() to render the command line
section, so opening chrome://policy now kills the browser process. 152 is
missing the same block but has no consumer.

The storage lives in an anonymous namespace in chrome_main.cc, so expose a
minimal setter and call it from GooroomMain at the same point upstream does,
before AppendExtraArgumentsToCommandLine(), keeping the snapshot unpolluted
as the upstream comment requires.

Index: gooroom-browser-debian.git/chrome/app/chrome_main.h
===================================================================
--- gooroom-browser-debian.git.orig/chrome/app/chrome_main.h
+++ gooroom-browser-debian.git/chrome/app/chrome_main.h
@@ -15,4 +15,10 @@
 // This function is only available in the browser process.
 const base::CommandLine& GetInitialBrowserCommandLine();
 
+// Stores the snapshot returned by GetInitialBrowserCommandLine(). Gooroom
+// replaces ChromeMain() with GooroomMain(), which must call this at the same
+// point upstream assigns the storage: right after CommandLine::Init() and
+// before any flag is appended.
+void SetInitialBrowserCommandLine(const base::CommandLine& command_line);
+
 #endif  // CHROME_APP_CHROME_MAIN_H_
Index: gooroom-browser-debian.git/chrome/app/chrome_main.cc
===================================================================
--- gooroom-browser-debian.git.orig/chrome/app/chrome_main.cc
+++ gooroom-browser-debian.git/chrome/app/chrome_main.cc
@@ -77,6 +77,10 @@
   return GetInitialCommandLineStorage().value();
 }
 
+void SetInitialBrowserCommandLine(const base::CommandLine& command_line) {
+  GetInitialCommandLineStorage() = command_line;
+}
+
 #if BUILDFLAG(IS_WIN)
